cvm-sigstore
============

This crate contains source code vendored from, and newly ported from,
third-party projects, all under the Apache License 2.0. A copy of that license
is in ./LICENSE.

Contents by origin:

    item 1  files vendored from tinfoilsh/tinfoil-rs, with local modifications
    item 2  portions deriving from sigstore/sigstore-rs, by way of tinfoil-rs
    item 3  files newly ported from tinfoilsh/tinfoil-go (policy, provenance)
    item 4  a genuine third-party Sigstore bundle kept as a test fixture

The "Local modifications" list under item 1 is the auditable delta from
upstream; it records removed and replaced APIs, not just additions.


